{"slug":"/references/js_sdk/admin/Product/methods/js_sdk.admin.Product.linkOptions","title":"linkOptions","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"linkoptions-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"linkoptions-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method links product options to a product. It allows adding new options,\nremoving existing ones, or updating option values. It sends a request to the\n[Batch Product Product Options](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#products\\_postproductsidoptionsbatch)\nAPI route."},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"This is available starting from [Medusa v2.16.0](https://github.com/medusajs/medusa/releases/tag/v2.16.0)."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nsdk.admin.product.linkOptions(\"prod_123\", {\n  add: [\n      \"opt_123\",\n      {\n        id: \"opt_123\",\n        value_ids: [\"optval_1\", \"optval_2\"]\n      }\n    ],\n    remove: [\"opt_456\"]\n})\n.then(({ product }) => {\n  console.log(product)\n})\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"linkoptions-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"linkOptions","types":[{"name":"productId","type":"`string`","description":"The product's ID.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"body","type":"[AdminLinkProductOptions](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminLinkProductOptions)","description":"The options to add or remove.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"add","type":"(`string` \\| [AdminCreateProductOption](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminCreateProductOption) \\| [AdminLinkProductOptionWithValues](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminLinkProductOptionWithValues))[]","description":"The list of options to add to the product. You can pass either:\n\n1. The ID of an existing product option as a string.\n2. An object with `id` and `value_ids` to add an existing product option with specific values. This\nis useful when you want to associate only specific option values of an option to the product.\n3. An object to create a new product option.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"title","type":"`string`","description":"The option's title.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"values","type":"`string`[]","description":"The option's values.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"ranks","type":"`Record<string, number>`","description":"The rank for each option value. The keys are the option values,\nand the values are their respective ranks.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","example":"{ * \"Small\": 1, * \"Medium\": 2, * \"Large\": 3 * }","expandable":false,"children":[],"since":"2.16.0"},{"name":"is_exclusive","type":"`boolean`","description":"Whether the option is exclusive to a specific product,\nor can be shared across multiple products.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[],"since":"2.16.0"},{"name":"id","type":"`string`","description":"The ID of the product option to add.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"value_ids","type":"`string`[]","description":"The IDs of specific option values to add to the product.\nThis is useful when you want to associate only specific values of an option to the product.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]},{"name":"remove","type":"`string`[]","description":"The list of options to remove from the product.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"update","type":"[AdminUpdateProductOptionValues](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminUpdateProductOptionValues)[]","description":"The list of product option 